From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Apr 2026 16:12:30 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3846/5749] fix(ci): typecheck script tooling in CI workflow

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
---
 .github/workflows/ci.yml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
index 3b43bde6..53959d5e 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -66,6 +66,9 @@ jobs:
       - name: Type check
         run: bun run typecheck
 
+      - name: Type check script tooling
+        run: bunx tsc --noEmit -p script/tsconfig.json
+
   build:
     runs-on: ubuntu-latest
     needs: [test, typecheck]
